    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994060/extras/de26ec3e15a273d3737444eeedb5cee0.poster.avif?t=1753436915\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994060/extras/de26ec3e15a273d3737444eeedb5cee0.webm?t=1753436915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994060/extras/de26ec3e15a273d3737444eeedb5cee0.mp4?t=1753436915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6How to play </h2>The game is advanced by cultivating the favorability with the maid. As the favorability level increases, more scenes, dialogues and functions will be unlocked.<br>Observing can help you see what the maid is doing and sometimes provide helpful information.<br>There will be no penalty for the favorability to decrease, only an increase in favorability, so don't worry about anything bad happening!<br><br>As long as the conditions are met, you can ask the maid to change your clothes and hairstyle at any time, and the H scene will change more expressions in time as the favorability increases! You can freely choose the difference, and there are dozens to hundreds of combinations to suit your preferences.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Game Features </h2>\u25c7 All h scenes are animations that focus on practicality<br>\u25c7 8 H scenes in total<br>\u25c7 Relaxed cohabitation SLG with no ending<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Problem reporting and notes: </h2>DLsite is the mosaic version, steam is the non-mosaic version.<br>The contents of both are exactly the same, please pay attention before purchasing!!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994060/extras/de26ec3e15a273d3737444eeedb5cee0.poster.avif?t=1753436915\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994060/extras/de26ec3e15a273d3737444eeedb5cee0.webm?t=1753436915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1994060/extras/de26ec3e15a273d3737444eeedb5cee0.mp4?t=1753436915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6How to play </h2>The game is advanced by cultivating the favorability with the maid. As the favorability level increases, more scenes, dialogues and functions will be unlocked.<br>Observing can help you see what the maid is doing and sometimes provide helpful information.<br>There will be no penalty for the favorability to decrease, only an increase in favorability, so don't worry about anything bad happening!<br><br>As long as the conditions are met, you can ask the maid to change your clothes and hairstyle at any time, and the H scene will change more expressions in time as the favorability increases! You can freely choose the difference, and there are dozens to hundreds of combinations to suit your preferences.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Game Features </h2>\u25c7 All h scenes are animations that focus on practicality<br>\u25c7 8 H scenes in total<br>\u25c7 Relaxed cohabitation SLG with no ending<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6Problem reporting and notes: </h2>DLsite is the mosaic version, steam is the non-mosaic version.<br>The contents of both are exactly the same, please pay attention before purchasing!!",
